{"person_name": "Reverend Mother Gaius Helen Mohiam", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.6, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The Reverend Mother must combine the seductive wiles of a courtesan with the untouchable majesty of a virgin goddess, holding these attributes in tension so long as the powers of her youth endure.", "start": 168, "end": 308}, {"text": "She knows now that the ninety generations have produced that person. Here I stand . . . but . . . I . . . will . . . never . . . do . . . her . . . bidding!", "start": 2043, "end": 2140}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Even the Padishah Emperor's Truthsayer couldn't evade that responsibility when the duty call came.", "start": 451, "end": 532}, {"text": "She could wait with her sisters -ninety generations for the proper combination of genes and environment to produce the one person their schemes required.", "start": 2100, "end": 2210}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.6, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The old woman's voice was snappish, demanding.", "start": 1085, "end": 1125}, {"text": "The old woman pulled her shapeless black robes around her, pressed forward out of the crowd to stand at the barrier lances.", "start": 1860, "end": 1940}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.2, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Damn that Jessica! the Reverend Mother thought. If only she 'd borne us a girl as she was ordered to do!", "start": 533, "end": 613}, {"text": "For your part in all this I could gladly have you strangled, he said. You couldn't prevent it! he snapped as she stiffened in rage.", "start": 2211, "end": 2300}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "She was feeling her age this morning, more than a little petulant. She blamed it on space travel and association with that abominable Spacing Guild and its secretive ways.", "start": 365, "end": 451}, {"text": "The old Truthsayer, the Reverend Mother Gaius Helen Mohiam, had her own view of the hidden meaning in Paul's words now. She glimpsed the jihad and said: You cannot loose these people upon the universe!", "start": 2480, "end": 2600}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_4", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_25", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_622", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_628", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_643", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_670"]}
{"person_name": "Baron Vladimir Harkonnen", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.6, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The whole universe sat there, open to the man who could make the right decisions.", "start": 1015, "end": 1083}, {"text": "Here in his quarters, though, the ship's harsh metal was disguised with draperies, with fabric paddings and rare art objects.", "start": 1605, "end": 1688}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The drug was timed,\" he rumbled. \"We knew to the minute when you'd be coming out of it.", "start": 276, "end": 340}, {"text": "Who would think of reviving artillery in this day of shields? The thought was a chuckle in his mind.", "start": 944, "end": 1014}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.4, "confidence": 0.5, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The Baron Vladimir Harkonnen raged down the corridor from his private apartments, flitting through patches of late afternoon sunlight.", "start": 2300, "end": 2380}, {"text": "The Baron Vladimir Harkonnen stood at a viewport of the grounded lighter he was using as a command post.", "start": 688, "end": 764}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.2, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Pity should be cruel! He nodded. Failure was, by definition, expendable.", "start": 1084, "end": 1138}, {"text": "Let him sweat a little, the Baron thought. One must always keep the tools of statecraft sharp and ready. Power and fear--sharp and ready.", "start": 1760, "end": 1840}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The Baron Vladimir Harkonnen raged down the corridor from his private apartments, flitting through patches of late afternoon sunlight.", "start": 2300, "end": 2380}, {"text": "The Baron noted the trace of semuta dullness in Nefud's eyes. It was obvious the man had been deep within the drug's rapture when he received this report.", "start": 1689, "end": 1779}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_215", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_230", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_300", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_435", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_478", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_587", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_600"]}
{"person_name": "Leto", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The Duke Leto, whose qualities as a father have long been overlooked.", "start": 108, "end": 166}, {"text": "The Duke forced himself to the casual gesture, sat down on a corner of the table, smiled.", "start": 1083, "end": 1155}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The Duke was tall, olive-skinned. His thin face held harsh angles warmed only by deep gray eyes.", "start": 1000, "end": 1074}, {"text": "I must use every opportunity to rest during the crossing to Arrakis, he thought. There'll be no rest on Arrakis.", "start": 1156, "end": 1240}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.4, "confidence": 0.5, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul watched his father enter the training room, saw the guards take up stations outside.", "start": 875, "end": 944}, {"text": "The Duke said: \"Hard at work, Son?\" He crossed to the ell table, glanced at the papers on it, swept his gaze around the room and back to Paul.", "start": 945, "end": 1082}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The devotion with which men served him. You see him there -- a man snared by Destiny, a lonely figure with his light dimmed behind the glory of his son.", "start": 108, "end": 246}, {"text": "The Duke forced himself to the casual gesture, sat down on a corner of the table, smiled.", "start": 1083, "end": 1155}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.6, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "He felt tired, filled with the ache of not showing his fatigue.", "start": 1083, "end": 1155}, {"text": "Paul nodded, suddenly overcome by memory of the Reverend Mother's words: \" . . . for the father, nothing.\"", "start": 1241, "end": 1320}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_1", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_2", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_15", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_16", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_17", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_20", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_23", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_27", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_33", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_46", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_51", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_59", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_60", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_65", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_66", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_78", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_79", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_80", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_81", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_82", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_92", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_93", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_98", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_99", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_102", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_103", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_104", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_105", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_106", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_107", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_109", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_110", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_111", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_112", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_114", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_118", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_119", "dune-1-