{"person_name": "Emperor", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.5, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The Emperor and his friends now command fifty-nine point six-five per cent of the CHOAM directorship's votes. Certainly they smell profits, and likely as others smell those same profits his voting strength will increase.", "start": 5, "end": 168}, {"text": "In politics, the tripod is the most unstable of all structures. It'd be bad enough without the complication of a feudal trade culture which turns its back on most science.", "start": 169, "end": 329}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "A beginning is the time for taking the most delicate care that the balances are correct. This every sister of the Bene Gesserit knows.", "start": 0, "end": 118}, {"text": "The forms have been obeyed.", "start": 119, "end": 145}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.4, "confidence": 0.4, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The Emperor and his friends now command fifty-nine point six-five per cent of the CHOAM directorship's votes.", "start": 5, "end": 168}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.4, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Damn that Jessica! the Reverend Mother thought. If only she 'd borne us a girl as she was ordered to do!", "start": 0, "end": 118}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.5, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Jessica closed her eyes, feeling tears press out beneath the lids. She fought down the inner trembling, the outer trembling, the uneven breathing, the ragged pulse, the sweating of the palms.", "start": 0, "end": 168}, {"text": "For a heartbeat, fear pulsed through her palm. Then she had herself under control.", "start": 169, "end": 329}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_0", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_3", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_4",